  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiji Gender Action Programme: Marama ni Viti</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Achieving multi-sectoral change requires broad outputs including community education, counselling and access to quality social and healthcare services, including for survivors of gender-based violence, capacity building in gender mainstreaming, civil society strengthening and leadership development. Targeted funding will contribute to a more vibrant gender sector and strengthened women&apos;s organisations better positioned to reach women and girls in all their diversity.</narrative>
  </description>
